                </p><div class="access_block"><h4 class="condition">When FEAT_SRMASK is implemented:</h4><div class="encoding"><p class="asm-code">MRS &lt;Xt&gt;, ACTLRALIAS_EL1</p></div></div><p style="text-align: right">
